  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour Mobility for Sustainable Development and Climate Resilience in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This joint programme aims to enhance the benefits of safe and fair migration as a sustainable development and climate resilience strategy via improved labour migration governance, decent work principles and standards in labour migration programmes, promotion of safe and regular labour mobility programmes, and improved reintegration support by national governments and key stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
